{
  "name": "Turn new Google Sheets rows into vertical AI videos with Treza",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "239b7752-100d-5c6c-a287-3851d741289a",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 760,
        "content": "## A vertical video for every new row\nPlan short videos in a spreadsheet. Each new row becomes a 9:16 AI video clip, and the clip's link and status are written back to the same row, so the sheet doubles as your content calendar.\n\n### How it works\n1. **New row in sheet** checks the sheet every minute for added rows.\n2. **Settings** sets the shape, the length and the spend cap for every clip.\n3. **Generate the video** gets a quote from Treza, stops if it is over **Max Cost**, and waits for the render.\n4. **Write the link back** fills in `video_url` and `status` on the row that started it.\n\n### Setup\n1. Make a sheet with the columns `prompt`, `title`, `video_url` and `status`.\n2. Pick that sheet in both Google Sheets nodes and connect your Google account.\n3. Add your Treza API credential to **Generate the video**.\n4. Activate the workflow and add a row with a prompt.\n\n### Customization\nChange the shape to 16:9 or 1:1 in **Settings**, or the length up to the model's limit. To post the clip somewhere, add a YouTube, TikTok or Slack node after **Generate the video**.\n\n### Requirements\n- The verified community node **Treza** (`@treza/n8n-nodes-treza`, tested with 0.1.3 on n8n 2.46.6). On n8n Cloud, search for Treza in the nodes panel. Self-hosted: Settings > Community Nodes. Guide: https://www.trezalabs.com/integrations/n8n\n- A Treza API key from https://www.trezalabs.com/platform/api-keys with the pipelines:read, pipelines:write and pipelines:run permissions, saved as a **Treza API** credential."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5f744eaf-f284-5b29-bdf4-28d86372d915",
      "name": "Note: plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 1. Plan in a sheet\nEvery new row with a `prompt` starts one video. **Settings** holds the shape, length and spend cap.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "487a7788-edec-55ec-8e3f-15cba540655c",
      "name": "Note: render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 2. Render\nTreza quotes the clip first and stops, with nothing charged, if it costs more than Max Cost.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2dc26d98-3af6-55fb-af55-5d4b05696c1c",
      "name": "Note: write back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        760,
        -140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 300,
        "height": 420,
        "content": "## 3. Write back\nThe video link and a status land on the same row.",
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b7475e93-8af5-5f8a-a8b3-ca7d4534d09f",
      "name": "New row in sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fdb0746d-c36d-5424-acbb-1fae9dbad322",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5e2f6a7a-a6d8-5151-a8f7-5f1393241f3f",
              "name": "aspectRatio",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "9:16"
            },
            {
              "id": "50ff3759-5226-5b12-80b0-b90944a91687",
              "name": "seconds",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 8
            },
            {
              "id": "be7326d4-e16b-5a53-a7c3-5eb915d93b9b",
              "name": "maxCostUsd",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "includeOtherFields": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aec5b463-8ad9-504c-8083-8aa215503cbc",
      "name": "Generate the video",
      "type": "@treza/n8n-nodes-treza.treza",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "video",
        "operation": "generate",
        "prompt": "={{ $json.prompt }}",
        "aspectRatio": "={{ $json.aspectRatio }}",
        "durationSec": "={{ $json.seconds }}",
        "maxCostUsd": "={{ $json.maxCostUsd }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "name": "={{ $json.title }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f9e1d11a-ee21-5ba5-9a74-a83804e238df",
      "name": "Write the link back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        820,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('New row in sheet').item.json.row_number }}",
            "video_url": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.timedOut ? 'still rendering: ' + $json.runId : 'done' }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "row_number"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "row_number",
              "displayName": "row_number",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "readOnly": true
            },
            {
              "id": "video_url",
              "displayName": "video_url",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "displayName": "status",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    }
  ],
